@baseUrl = http://localhost:5151
@advisorToken = replace-with-advisor-jwt
@studentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@caseId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@termId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003

### Read a student's profile for a case and academic term
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/StudentIndicators/students/{{studentId}}/profile?caseId={{caseId}}&termId={{termId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{advisorToken}}

### Malformed caseId is rejected by API model validation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/StudentIndicators/students/{{studentId}}/profile?caseId=not-a-guid
Authorization: Bearer {{advisorToken}}

### Reconstruct a student's profile as of a date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/StudentIndicators/students/{{studentId}}/as-of?date=2026-10-31&caseId={{caseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{advisorToken}}

### Compare two point-in-time profiles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/StudentIndicators/students/{{studentId}}/compare?dateA=2026-10-31&dateB=2026-11-30&caseId={{caseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{advisorToken}}

### Read the authenticated student's own indicator profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/StudentIndicators/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Download the authenticated student's JSON data export
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/StudentIndicators/me/export
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
